<TABLE width="633" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<TR><TD width="633">
<font face="Arial, Verdana" size="-1">
<img src="charter.gif" width="283" height="40" alt="Charter"><BR><BR>

<i><b><font size="4" face="times new roman"><div align="center">From the struggle of battle comes honor, respect and glory<BR> 
Only through Bravery and Courage shall we live and prosper<BR>
At peace we have nothing to live for<BR>
At war we have everything to fight for</div></font></b></i><BR>



<BLOCKQUOTE>
The knights of Valorblade seek to better themselves in the ways of battle in order to be a powerful army of skilled fighters. We have devotion to none other than ourselves and we shall protect the honor of our guild with our lives. Our goal is rely on no power at all in the world, we will not be led by any goverment or authority but that of our own. The powerful governments of this world are corrupt, only a powerful rebel force can throw them back into alignment. They must be punished for what they have done! Passive ways have done nothing but waste valuable time. It's time to build the greatest army Norrath has ever seen, once built everything we need will be at our immediate grasp!
<BR><BR>
Being a part of the Valorblade is about loving the heat of battle, it's about not being at peace until you are in a state of constant war. It's about cracking your knuckles and tapping your boot with impatience when you aren't in the thick of a dangerous fight with a deadly beast. And most of all it's really about pride, it's about showing the world that you are the best of the best when it comes to your fighting skills. Only the bravest and most courageous men can stand up for what they believe and spit in the face of authority. Entire kingdoms may not fall at our feet in the beginning, but something must be done before it's too late. Great battles will rage across norrath, we must prepare ourselves now!
<BR><BR>
When the many battles are fought the times of peace crumble, where will you be? Who will stand by your side? As citizens we need to stick together, as part of ValorBlade you'll be well taken care of. Every man who serves ValorBlade will be part of our brotherhood, and in times of battle we will have victory! None of us stand a chance alone.

</BLOCKQUOTE>


</font>
